--- stderr
oge: this Run isn't valid
  --require held-out: Fast mode doesn't give this guarantee; use Standard (the default) or --blind
  --require magic: unknown guarantee; known: held-out
  --agent implement=gemini: unknown agent; use one of claude, codex
  --verify: no verifier Stage in this mode; use --agent <stage>=<agent>
